    "answer": {
      "short": "$95\\%$",
      "worked": "Income kept: $1600-80=1520$ dollars.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Fraction kept}&=\\frac{1520}{1600}\\\\\\text{Fraction kept}&=\\frac{95}{100}\\\\\\text{Percentage kept}&=95\\%\\end{align*}$$",
